1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:04,771
Imagine a five and a half acre pool
complex, right on the Las Vegas Strip.

2
00:00:04,901 --> 00:00:10,260
That's Resorts World Las Vegas: four and a
half stars, and an eight point eight out

3
00:00:10,290 --> 00:00:12,597
of ten from fifteen thousand guests.

4
00:00:12,727 --> 00:00:18,675
In this tour: the pools, a spa with sauna
rituals, twenty restaurants, and a theatre

5
00:00:18,705 --> 00:00:21,878
with four thousand eight hundred fifty
seats.

6
00:00:22,008 --> 00:00:25,669
I'll show you the room to pick, and my
honest score comes last.

7
00:00:25,799 --> 00:00:27,083
First, the pools.

8
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:32,173
There are five pool experiences, spread
across nine bodies of water.

9
00:00:32,303 --> 00:00:37,431
One of them is an eighteen hundred square
foot infinity pool with views of the

10
00:00:37,461 --> 00:00:37,828
Strip.

11
00:00:37,958 --> 00:00:44,018
Rent a cabana, grab a lounger, and settle
in, because pool access runs from nine to

12
00:00:44,048 --> 00:00:44,385
four.

13
00:00:44,530 --> 00:00:45,529
Now, the spa.

14
00:00:45,687 --> 00:00:50,163
Awana Spa and Wellness covers twenty-seven
thousand square feet.

15
00:00:50,293 --> 00:00:55,661
It is the first spa in the United States
to offer the Art of Aufguss, a sauna

16
00:00:55,691 --> 00:00:56,152
ritual.

17
00:00:56,282 --> 00:01:00,176
Hydrotherapy, sports massage and body
wraps are on the menu too.

18
00:01:00,306 --> 00:01:04,923
The spa hours aren't published on the
pages I checked, so book your treatment
ahead.

19
00:01:05,053 --> 00:01:06,123
Now, the food.

20
00:01:06,358 --> 00:01:11,362
Expedia counts twenty restaurants, and the
resort lists more than fifty places to

21
00:01:11,392 --> 00:01:12,232
eat and drink.

22
00:01:12,362 --> 00:01:18,063
Famous Foods Street Eats is a hall of
eighteen vendors, from dumplings to ramen
to

23
00:01:18,093 --> 00:01:18,692
barbecue.

24
00:01:18,822 --> 00:01:24,242
For a big night, Genting Palace serves a
signature seafood buffet from Wednesday to

25
00:01:24,272 --> 00:01:24,702
Sunday.

26
00:01:24,832 --> 00:01:29,867
Sun's Out Buns Out is open twenty-four
seven, and DawgHouse Saloon pours beer
with

27
00:01:29,897 --> 00:01:30,423
pub food.

28
00:01:30,553 --> 00:01:35,100
Most hours aren't published, and a
breakfast buffet is about thirty-six
dollars per

29
00:01:35,130 --> 00:01:35,431
adult.

30
00:01:35,561 --> 00:01:36,642
Now, the night.

31
00:01:36,772 --> 00:01:40,523
The Resorts World Theatre holds four
thousand eight hundred fifty people.

32
00:01:40,653 --> 00:01:43,871
Past headliners include Katy Perry and
Kevin Hart.

33
00:01:44,001 --> 00:01:48,874
A nightclub and a dayclub add almost a
hundred thousand square feet of party
space.

34
00:01:49,004 --> 00:01:53,575
And on the sixty-sixth floor, a lounge has
views over the whole Strip.

35
00:01:53,705 --> 00:01:57,249
The casino adds a hundred seventeen
thousand square feet.

36
00:01:57,379 --> 00:01:58,520
Now, your room.

37
00:01:58,652 --> 00:02:02,883
The Hilton tower has one thousand six
hundred seventy-eight rooms.

38
00:02:03,013 --> 00:02:07,697
A Deluxe King is three hundred ninety-
eight square feet, with a fifty-five inch
TV

39
00:02:07,727 --> 00:02:08,847
and premium bedding.

40
00:02:08,977 --> 00:02:13,576
Ask for a Strip view room, rated eight
point six out of ten by guests.

41
00:02:13,706 --> 00:02:17,562
Two Queen rooms sleep four, and room
service runs twenty-four hours.

42
00:02:17,692 --> 00:02:20,888
Guests give the rooms a nine point four
for cleanliness.

43
00:02:21,018 --> 00:02:25,180
Resorts World sits on the north end of the
Strip, where guests describe a laid-back

44
00:02:25,210 --> 00:02:25,433
vibe.

45
00:02:25,563 --> 00:02:30,046
The Adventuredome and the Circus Circus
casino are five minutes on foot, and the

46
00:02:30,076 --> 00:02:31,625
Fashion Show Mall is twelve.

47
00:02:31,755 --> 00:02:35,986
The Vegas Loop runs underground in
electric Teslas to the Convention Center,
and the

48
00:02:36,016 --> 00:02:37,762
airport is fourteen minutes by car.

49
00:02:37,892 --> 00:02:38,748
A few tips.

50
00:02:39,351 --> 00:02:43,104
The resort fee covers phone calls and pool
access, and it is charged per night.

51
00:02:43,234 --> 00:02:48,030
Parking is not free: twenty-one dollars a
day to park yourself, forty for valet.

52
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:53,640
Check in is at 4 PM, check out is 11 AM,
and cash is not accepted, so bring a card.

53
00:02:53,770 --> 00:02:56,716
Check which pools are open for your dates
before you go.

54
00:02:56,846 --> 00:02:58,273
So, is it worth it?

55
00:02:58,510 --> 00:03:02,978
Eight point eight out of ten, and about
seven in ten guests gave a perfect ten.

56
00:03:03,108 --> 00:03:06,374
Cleanliness and property conditions both
score nine point four.

57
00:03:06,504 --> 00:03:08,624
My honest score: eight and a half out of
ten.

58
00:03:08,754 --> 00:03:13,340
Great for friends and couples who want
pools, a spa and a big night out under one

59
00:03:13,370 --> 00:03:13,625
roof.

60
00:03:13,755 --> 00:03:16,039
The link is in the description.
